  "body": "https://notifications.spec.whatwg.org/#service-worker-api\n\nAny context which has access to a ServiceWorkerRegistration object can display persistent notifications, which includes Documents. However, only Service Workers can access the list of existing notifications.\n\nWhat about having ServiceWorkerRegistration.getNotifications(...) instead?\n",
